<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">such as ReAct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">12</a>]</cite> style agents.</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<table id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Ability to define components that represent "resources"</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">(with no impact on conversation flow routing) such as</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">LLMs, memory, prompt templates, tools, other Agents</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.2.3.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">which can be attached to other components’ properties.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S1.T1.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Flows</th>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
