<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Author and edit graph-style workflows</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">such as multi-step business processes.</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<table id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Ability to define components that have a well-defined</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">execution path such as a directed graph which may</td></tr>
