<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.4.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">between components in the system,</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.4.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">including conditional or looping flows.</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<table id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Explicit "relationships" (edges) for control flow</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">supporting one-to-many and many-to-one transitions. The</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">specific transition to be taken is determined at</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.4.3.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">runtime for a given execution.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S1.T1.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">I/O routing</th>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<table id="S1.T1.5.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
