<td id="S1.T1.5.1.5.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">that are consumed in multiple places.</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<table id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Explicit "relationships" (edges) for data flow. Support</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">for one-to-many and many-to-one transitions where the specific</td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.5.1.5.3.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
