<td id="S2.T2.5.1.3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">PyTorch, TensorFlow) and</td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T2.5.1.3.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S2.T2.5.1.3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">executed in another.</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="S2.T2.5.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">
<table id="S2.T2.5.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
